OL,3,GNEWSA'Horrific' barn fire breaks out
OL,4,Anear care home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA care home manager was "on alert all
OL,7,Fevening" on Monday after a fire broke
OL,8,Fout on a nearby farm, in Warwickshire.
OL,10,FThe blaze, in Lawford Heath, erupted at
OL,11,Fabout 16.45 BST and involved a barn
OL,12,Fcontaining straw that was alight and
OL,13,Fwas beginning to spread to a nearby
OL,14,Ffield, Warwickshire Fire and Rescue
OL,15,FService said.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
