OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-% -$%%-%-$%%%%-!"$--%& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Horrific' barn fire breaks out
OL,4,Anear care home
OL,5,
OL,6,FJenny Banaszek, from Wolston Grange
OL,7,Fcare home, said a member of staff
OL,8,Falerted emergency services to the fire,
OL,9,Fin Coalpit Lane, that looked "quite
OL,10,Fhorrific", with a large plume of smoke
OL,11,Fvisible in Coventry, Rugby and
OL,12,FLeamington Spa.
OL,14,FMultiple crews worked through the night
OL,15,Fand the blaze was now "largely under
OL,16,Fcontrol", the fire service said.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
